## 7. Test Data

The test data includes:

- Valid SauceDemo user credentials.
- Invalid login credentials.
- Locked-out user credentials.
- Product names and prices.
- Valid checkout information.
- Checkout data with one required field omitted at a time.

The primary purchase scenario uses the `Sauce Labs Backpack` product.

Credentials must be maintained securely in the local `.env` file and must not be committed to source control.

